# StyleX only

This repo uses StyleX, not Tailwind. Read `AGENTS.md` and `.claude/docs/styling.md` before editing styles.

## Never

- Tailwind classes, `cva()`, `cn()`, `dark:` prefix
- Top-level `[mq.sm]: { }` or `:hover: { }` in `stylex.create` — nest inside property values with `default`
- Multi-value shorthands — split into longhands

## Always

- `stylex.create()` at module scope + `stylex.props()` on elements
- Tokens: `@/lib/tokens.stylex` (`colors`, `radius`)
- Breakpoints/type scale: `@/lib/constants.stylex` (`mq`, `font`, `leading`)
- Pair `font.*` with `leading.*`
- Builds: `--webpack` flag (see `package.json` scripts)

## UI components

Follow patterns in `components/ui/AGENTS.md`. Base UI uses `render` prop, not `asChild`.
